WEBVTT

00:01:58.239 --> 00:02:00.324
It’s not a technology from a lab.

00:02:00.366 --> 00:02:02.994
It’s not a policy made in Ottawa or DC.

00:02:03.578 --> 00:02:07.540
It is the fundamental understanding
that is expressed by our knowledge,

00:02:07.540 --> 00:02:10.585
by our elders and knowledge
keepers this way:

00:02:10.585 --> 00:02:14.964
If we take care of the land,
the land takes care of us.

00:02:16.174 --> 00:02:17.800
Let me say it again.

00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:22.180
If we take care of the land,
the land takes care of us.

00:02:22.680 --> 00:02:25.308
This is about a relationship,

00:02:25.349 --> 00:02:26.934
a mutual love story.

00:02:28.186 --> 00:02:33.816
(Applause)